  "description": "Command line OCR for PDF files: finds the scan on each page, recognizes Latin and Arabic text with the PP-OCRv5 models on ONNX Runtime, turns pages scanned sideways or upside down, and adds an invisible text layer so the PDF can be searched and copied. Models and runtime included; also runs as `pdfnetstack ocr` next to PdfNetStack.Tool. Install with: dotnet tool install -g PdfNetStack.Ocr.Tool. MIT licensed. By Jamal Abdelkhalek, JADEV.",
